Dialogue: 10,0:00:06.57,0:00:07.99,dialog,,0,0,0,,Satoko mana?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:07.99,0:00:10.03,dialog,,0,0,0,,Masih tidur.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:10.03,0:00:11.99,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dia sudah merawatmu berhari-hari.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:12.58,0:00:14.87,dialog,,0,0,0,,Akhirnya dia bisa istirahat.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:14.87,0:00:16.25,dialog,,0,0,0,,Begitu, ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:17.08,0:00:20.25,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mukanya sudah seperti orang mau mati, lo.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:20.58,0:00:25.05,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sepertinya dia sekuat tenaga menahan diri\Nagar tidak hancur karena
Dialogue: 10,0:00:25.05,0:00:27.76,dialog,,0,0,0,,begitu mengkhawatirkan Tuan Shinpei.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:27.76,0:00:29.30,dialog,,0,0,0,,Separah itu?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:29.59,0:00:32.34,dialog,,0,0,0,,Meski begitu,\Ntiap hari dia membasuh tubuhmu,
Dialogue: 10,0:00:32.34,0:00:35.43,dialog,,0,0,0,,mengganti perban dan mengoleskan obat.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:35.43,0:00:39.06,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bahkan sejenak pun tidak mau\Npergi dari sisimu.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:40.23,0:00:41.73,dialog,,0,0,0,,Satoko...
Dialogue: 10,0:00:41.73,0:00:45.78,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tiap hari menghangatkan tubuhku\Ndengan tidur sekasur bersamaku.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:46.65,0:00:48.65,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sampai melakukan itu?!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:48.65,0:00:49.78,dialog,,0,0,0,,Itu pasti cinta!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:49.78,0:00:50.78,dialog,,0,0,0,,Cinta?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:50.78,0:00:52.20,dialog,,0,0,0,,Itu cinta!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:52.20,0:00:54.70,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku dan Satoko saling mencintai?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:54.70,0:00:55.83,dialog,,0,0,0,,Iya!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:02.17,0:01:03.75,dialog,,0,0,0,,Cinta!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:03.75,0:01:06.46,dialog,,0,0,0,,Untung aku tidak membunuh siapa pun!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:06.46,0:01:07.38,dialog,,0,0,0,,Iya!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:07.38,0:01:10.42,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku juga merasakan cinta\Nsaat menemukan kalian di pinggir pantai!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:10.42,0:01:13.14,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dia mati-matian menciummu\Nagar dirimu memuntahkan air!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:13.14,0:01:14.47,dialog,,0,0,0,,Cium?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:15.30,0:01:16.68,dialog,,0,0,0,,Siapa yang mencium siapa?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:17.72,0:01:20.27,dialog,,0,0,0,,Satoko yang mencium Tuan Shinpei.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:20.56,0:01:24.02,dialog,,0,0,0,,Satoko menciumku?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:24.02,0:01:25.40,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tuan Shinpei!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:28.57,0:01:31.57,dialog,,0,0,0,,Maaf, aku ketiduran.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:32.28,0:01:36.95,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mana mungkin aku bilang tidak bisa tidur\Ngara-gara kejadian kemarin.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:36.95,0:01:40.45,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya-Ya sudah, aku harus kerja dulu.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:41.41,0:01:43.25,dialog,,0,0,0,,Terima kasih banyak.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:46.34,0:01:47.84,dialog,,0,0,0,,Canggung sekali.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:53.63,0:01:55.85,dialog,,0,0,0,,A-Ayo ganti perbannya!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:55.85,0:01:57.51,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tolong lepas kimonomu.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:57.51,0:01:58.97,dialog,,0,0,0,,Iya...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:00.27,0:02:03.06,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lukanya cepat sekali sembuh.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:03.06,0:02:05.35,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lukanya sebagian besar sudah menutup.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:05.35,0:02:06.52,dialog,,0,0,0,,Maaf, ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:07.61,0:02:08.90,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku gagal.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:10.73,0:02:12.70,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tolong jangan minta maaf.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:14.20,0:02:15.74,dialog,,0,0,0,,Untuk sekarang
Dialogue: 10,0:02:16.24,0:02:19.54,dialog,,0,0,0,,bisa kembali hidup-hidup saja, aku sudah...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:22.91,0:02:24.58,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jadi ini yang namanya cinta?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:24.58,0:02:25.29,dialog,,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:27.29,0:02:28.46,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dingin...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:29.04,0:02:31.51,dialog,,0,0,0,,Biar kuambilkan selembar futon lagi...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:33.26,0:02:35.47,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tolong jangan bercanda.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:36.39,0:02:38.43,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dingin sekali...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:38.43,0:02:41.47,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau boleh,\Ntolong hangatkan dengan tubuhmu...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:42.22,0:02:44.60,dialog,,0,0,0,,A-Asal tidak aneh-aneh...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:46.19,0:02:48.06,dialog,,0,0,0,,Imut sekali! Cinta banget!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:48.06,0:02:50.94,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sepertinya memang tidak kenapa-kenapa!\NAku akan keluar!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:50.94,0:02:52.32,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bercanda, aku bohong.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:52.32,0:02:54.95,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku janji tidak akan berbuat apa-apa.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:59.24,0:03:00.70,dialog,,0,0,0,,Satoko...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:00.70,0:03:03.20,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mungkin malah bikin makin dingin.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:03.20,0:03:05.79,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dikasih tahu begitu pun, harus bagaimana?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:06.25,0:03:07.71,dialog,,0,0,0,,He-Hei!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:08.21,0:03:09.71,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bikin tenang rasanya.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:11.42,0:03:14.34,dialog,,0,0,0,,Katanya kau menolongku di tepi pantai, ya?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:15.51,0:03:17.01,dialog,,0,0,0,,Iya.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:19.43,0:03:20.97,dialog,,0,0,0,,Memang cinta.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:20.97,0:03:23.27,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dari tadi kamu kenapa, sih?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:23.27,0:03:25.56,dialog,,0,0,0,,Cinta memang mantap, ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:25.56,0:03:27.77,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kamu paham maksud kata-katamu itu?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:27.77,0:03:29.27,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jelas paham, dong.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:29.27,0:03:33.53,dialog,,0,0,0,,Satoko sampai menciumku demi menyelamatkanku,\Nitu pasti karena cinta, kan?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:33.53,0:03:35.15,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ha-Habisnya tidak ada cara lain...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:35.49,0:03:38.41,dialog,,0,0,0,,Menghangatkanku di futon seperti ini\Njuga karena cinta.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:38.82,0:03:41.41,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mengoleskan obat itu juga cinta.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:41.78,0:03:45.62,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau membalas pelukanku,\Nitu lebih cinta lagi.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:48.75,0:03:52.21,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bukankah melepaskan orang yang\Ntidak mau dipeluk itu juga bentuk cinta?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:52.21,0:03:55.17,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau itu... bukan cinta.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:55.17,0:03:59.68,dialog,,0,0,0,,Wah, sepertinya persepsi kita\Nsoal cinta itu berbeda.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:01.35,0:04:04.22,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau sudah ganti baju,\Naku akan kembali lagi...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:05.60,0:04:08.64,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sudah kulepaskan sebentar, jadi sudah cinta!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:08.64,0:04:11.48,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kamu sepertinya memang tidak mengerti.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:11.94,0:04:13.65,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hei, jangan dorong-dorong!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:13.65,0:04:16.65,dialog,,0,0,0,,Katanya ada pelanggan gagah yang datang!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:16.65,0:04:19.45,dialog,,0,0,0,,Penampilannya rapi, kimononya juga bagus.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:19.45,0:04:21.82,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kenapa malah ke kedai bobrok begini?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:21.82,0:04:25.58,dialog,,0,0,0,,Maaf, kenapa Anda memilih tempat ini?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:26.83,0:04:30.25,dialog,,0,0,0,,Saya dengar ada pelacur\Nyang luar biasa cantiknya.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:30.25,0:04:33.71,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jadi, saya ingin menemuinya sendiri.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:08.01,0:06:09.43,dialog,,0,0,0,,Nona Satoko!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:10.64,0:06:12.31,dialog,,0,0,0,,Gawat, raut mukanya!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:12.31,0:06:14.23,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dokternya belum datang?!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:14.23,0:06:16.48,dialog,,0,0,0,,Pelayan baru saja dikirim untuk memanggil!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:16.48,0:06:19.36,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dengan badan seperti ini\Nkenapa malah pergi ke luar?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:22.40,0:06:25.53,dialog,,0,0,0,,Maaf, Satoko, sudah mengajakmu ke luar.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:25.53,0:06:27.66,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kenapa malah minta maaf?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:27.66,0:06:30.62,dialog,,0,0,0,,Yang bilang mau lihat pantai itu aku.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:31.50,0:06:34.29,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi, sepertinya memang tidak baik\Nmemaksakan diri.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:34.29,0:06:36.79,dialog,,0,0,0,,Malah merepotkan semua orang.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:38.34,0:06:42.30,dialog,,0,0,0,,Memar itu, kamu dimarahi Paman lagi?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:42.76,0:06:46.26,dialog,,0,0,0,,Maaf, Kochan, gara-gara aku.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:46.26,0:06:48.35,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tidak usah dipikirkan.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:48.35,0:06:51.27,dialog,,0,0,0,,Daripada itu,\Nberhentilah memanggilku Kochan begitu.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:52.35,0:06:55.56,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku tidak punya teman,\Njadi begitu senang rasanya.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:56.65,0:06:58.23,dialog,,0,0,0,,Cepat sembuh, ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:58.52,0:07:00.40,dialog,,0,0,0,,Nanti bakal kuajak ke pantai lagi.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:00.40,0:07:03.61,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lo? Kamu membawanya pulang?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:03.61,0:07:06.11,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ha-Habisnya kau bilang dikasih buatku!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:07.20,0:07:10.24,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sudahlah, aku sudah puas.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:11.33,0:07:14.91,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau selalu di dalam rumah,\Nmana mungkin bisa begitu.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:15.71,0:07:20.50,dialog,,0,0,0,,Habisnya kalau selalu memaksakan diri,\Nbisa jadi aku tidak akan tumbuh dewasa.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:22.05,0:07:23.67,dialog,,0,0,0,,Terima kasih.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:24.09,0:07:28.34,dialog,,0,0,0,,Pemandangan itu, suara ombak,\Njuga aroma garamnya
Dialogue: 10,0:07:28.34,0:07:29.43,dialog,,0,0,0,,tidak akan kulupakan.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:29.89,0:07:33.89,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mulai sekarang aku harus berhenti\Nbermanja-manja agar mimpiku terwujud.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:33.89,0:07:35.02,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mimpi?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:36.81,0:07:39.10,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku ingin menikah.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:40.23,0:07:42.94,dialog,,0,0,0,,Demi mimpi itulah aku hidup.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:46.86,0:07:48.95,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tuan Shinpei, bagaimana kondisi Anda?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:50.20,0:07:52.20,dialog,,0,0,0,,Oh, Pak Yamamoto.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:52.53,0:07:54.95,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku pinjam lentera yang tidak terpakai, ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:54.95,0:07:57.21,dialog,,0,0,0,,Buat apa sebanyak ini?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:57.58,0:07:59.50,dialog,,0,0,0,,Pengganti kunang-kunang.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:59.50,0:08:00.63,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kunang-kunang?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:00.63,0:08:03.71,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kukira Satoko akan senang.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:04.71,0:08:05.88,dialog,,0,0,0,,Pak Yamamoto.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:05.88,0:08:09.30,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku ingin tinggal di sini sama Satoko.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:09.30,0:08:12.22,dialog,,0,0,0,,Te-Tentu saja tidak masalah.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:12.22,0:08:13.97,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kira-kira sampai berapa lama?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:15.97,0:08:17.14,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sampai mati.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:18.69,0:08:23.44,dialog,,0,0,0,,Satoko yang sekarang\Nkurasa pasti akan setuju.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:23.44,0:08:28.20,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku mencintai Satoko\Nlebih dari siapa pun di dunia ini.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:30.11,0:08:31.53,dialog,,0,0,0,,Makanya,
Dialogue: 10,0:08:31.53,0:08:34.99,dialog,,0,0,0,,mulai sekarang jangan suruh\NSatoko bekerja jadi pelacur.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:34.99,0:08:36.91,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apalagi sampai ditebus.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:38.91,0:08:40.62,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aduh, maaf.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:40.62,0:08:43.63,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sebenarnya saya ingin membahas soal itu...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:46.46,0:08:48.13,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hah?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:48.76,0:08:50.63,dialog,,0,0,0,,Memesanku?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:50.63,0:08:53.47,dialog,,0,0,0,,Iya, pria yang gagah sekali.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:53.47,0:08:55.14,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kenapa malah aku?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:55.14,0:08:57.77,dialog,,0,0,0,,"Bidadari yang menari\Ndi tengah alun-alun pulau."
Dialogue: 10,0:08:57.77,0:09:01.65,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ada banyak pelanggan yang datang\Nkarena dengar rumor itu.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:01.65,0:09:04.36,dialog,,0,0,0,,Meski semuanya diusir sama Goto.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:04.90,0:09:07.61,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mungkin karena yang ini kaya raya,
Dialogue: 10,0:09:07.61,0:09:09.95,dialog,,0,0,0,,makanya Yamamoto mempersilakannya masuk.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:09.95,0:09:13.62,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sana, temani dia mengobrol.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:13.62,0:09:17.12,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa akan aman tidak bilang\Nke Tuan Shinpei begini?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:18.50,0:09:21.87,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi sekarang dia harus fokus\Nmenyembuhkan lukanya.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:23.17,0:09:24.71,dialog,,0,0,0,,Permisi.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:43.81,0:09:45.61,dialog,,0,0,0,,Syukurlah Anda baik-baik saja!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:47.23,0:09:49.94,dialog,,0,0,0,,Karena hari itu\Nsaya lengah mengawasi Anda...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:49.94,0:09:52.24,dialog,,0,0,0,,Saya mohon maaf yang sebesar-besarnya!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:52.24,0:09:55.28,dialog,,0,0,0,,Begitu pulang ke kediaman Kirigaya,\Nsaya akan minta maaf dengan harakiri!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:55.28,0:09:58.29,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bi-Bilang apa kamu ini?!\NSaat itu...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:58.87,0:09:59.70,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tunggu sebentar.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:00.16,0:10:02.46,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bisa gawat kalau obrolan ini didengar orang.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:02.46,0:10:04.71,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku di sini untuk lari dari pengejar.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:10.42,0:10:13.26,dialog,,0,0,0,,Siapa sangka Anda sampai bekerja\Ndi rumah bordil.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:13.76,0:10:16.76,dialog,,0,0,0,,Padahal kuharap itu tidak benar.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:16.76,0:10:18.89,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tenang saja, Kotaro.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:18.89,0:10:22.48,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku tidak akan semudah itu\Nmenyerahkan diriku.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:22.93,0:10:23.94,dialog,,0,0,0,,Benarkah?!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:23.94,0:10:25.35,dialog,,0,0,0,,Benar, kok.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:27.69,0:10:29.23,dialog,,0,0,0,,Syukurlah.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:30.78,0:10:32.49,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kenapa bisa tahu aku di sini?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:33.20,0:10:36.62,dialog,,0,0,0,,Pria bernama Nitobe yang memberi tahu.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:36.62,0:10:38.28,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tuan Nitobe?!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:38.78,0:10:41.83,dialog,,0,0,0,,Karena itu, saya memakai koneksi lama.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:41.83,0:10:44.08,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bukan sebagai pengawal keluarga Kirigaya.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:44.08,0:10:47.63,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi saya datang kemari sebagai Ogawa Kotaro,\Nseorang anak saudagar.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:48.09,0:10:53.05,dialog,,0,0,0,,Meski dengan kuasa keluarga Kirigaya,\Nmustahil ikut campur urusan pulau ini.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:53.51,0:10:57.01,dialog,,0,0,0,,Karena itu, sesuai aturan pulau,
Dialogue: 10,0:10:57.01,0:10:59.76,dialog,,0,0,0,,saya akan menebus Anda.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:09.73,0:11:12.11,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mari pulang ke kediaman Kirigaya\Nsekarang juga!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:15.49,0:11:16.61,dialog,,0,0,0,,Anu...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:21.91,0:11:23.41,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ada apa?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:23.87,0:11:25.75,dialog,,0,0,0,,Saya merasakan keberadaan orang.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:25.75,0:11:27.67,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sepertinya cuma perasaan saya saja.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:28.17,0:11:29.96,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kita akan naik kapal tiga hari lagi.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:29.96,0:11:30.54,dialog,,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:30.54,0:11:32.38,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ba-Baiklah!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:32.38,0:11:34.38,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi, aku punya sebuah permintaan.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:34.80,0:11:37.88,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ada orang yang ingin kuajak bersama.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:37.88,0:11:39.39,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mohon maaf.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:39.39,0:11:42.18,dialog,,0,0,0,,Uang tebusannya hanya untuk\NNona Satoko seorang.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:42.18,0:11:45.06,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ah, bukan seorang pelacur, tapi pria.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:45.60,0:11:47.06,dialog,,0,0,0,,Pria?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:47.39,0:11:48.60,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dia...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:48.60,0:11:51.69,dialog,,0,0,0,,bilang ingin menikah denganku.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:54.86,0:11:56.82,dialog,,0,0,0,,Permisi.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:56.82,0:12:00.74,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tuan Ogawa, bolehkah saya memberi sambutan?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:03.29,0:12:07.79,dialog,,0,0,0,,Perkenalkan, saya Goto,\Nyang diutus untuk mengurus rumah bordil ini.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:07.79,0:12:11.54,dialog,,0,0,0,,Saya dengar Anda sudah memberi\Nuang tebusan yang sangat besar.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:11.54,0:12:14.17,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jadi izinkan kami melayani Anda\Ndengan sepenuh hati.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:14.17,0:12:16.72,dialog,,0,0,0,,A-Apa yang ingin dia lakukan?!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:16.72,0:12:20.47,dialog,,0,0,0,,Terima kasih atas perhatiannya,\Ntapi saya ingin Nona Sato...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:20.47,0:12:23.64,dialog,,0,0,0,,Saya ingin dilayani Satoko seorang diri.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:24.81,0:12:27.73,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sudah, jangan begitu.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:27.73,0:12:29.81,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mari, sini.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:32.90,0:12:34.94,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau begitu, akan saya terima tawarannya.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:46.24,0:12:49.46,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa yang sebenarnya dia pikirkan?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:49.46,0:12:51.33,dialog,,0,0,0,,Padahal sedang terluka parah.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:51.33,0:12:53.79,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mau mengawasiku begitu?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:59.88,0:13:02.43,dialog,,0,0,0,,Biar saya suguhkan sake yang lain.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:02.43,0:13:04.35,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sudah, tidak perlu.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:05.47,0:13:07.43,dialog,,0,0,0,,Oh, begitu?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:08.52,0:13:13.06,dialog,,0,0,0,,Padahal banyak yang harus\Ndijelaskan ke Kotaro.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:13.06,0:13:16.32,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bagaimana kalau Satoko\Njuga menampilkan tarian?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:16.32,0:13:18.65,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tuan Ogawa pasti senang.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:18.65,0:13:20.78,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ke-Kenapa dadakan sekali?!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:20.78,0:13:21.40,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tidak usah.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:21.40,0:13:24.03,dialog,,0,0,0,,Biarkan dia ada di sampingku.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:26.54,0:13:30.16,dialog,,0,0,0,,Anda kelihatannya begitu menyukai Satoko.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:30.16,0:13:34.21,dialog,,0,0,0,,Anda unik sekali, mau menebus padahal\Nbelum bertatap muka sebelumnya.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:34.21,0:13:36.88,dialog,,0,0,0,,Saya memang tidak kuat kalau\Nmelihat wanita cantik.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:38.88,0:13:42.30,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bahaya kalau ketahuan dia sebenarnya\Nbukan pelanggan!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:42.80,0:13:45.89,dialog,,0,0,0,,Nanti biar kujelaskan juga ke Tuan Shinpei.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:45.89,0:13:50.14,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mumpung kesempatan,\Nizinkan saya menampilkan tarian.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:50.14,0:13:54.56,dialog,,0,0,0,,Setelah itu, bagaimana kalau kita bertiga\Nmengobrol dulu dengan tenang?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:54.56,0:13:55.81,dialog,,0,0,0,,Boleh.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:57.90,0:13:59.82,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku tidak apa-apa!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:14.58,0:14:17.92,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kehidupan seperti apa\Nyang dia jalani di sini?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:17.92,0:14:20.05,dialog,,0,0,0,,Benar juga.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:20.42,0:14:22.88,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bersih-bersih dan bekerja di belakang layar.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:22.88,0:14:25.39,dialog,,0,0,0,,Pokoknya dia anak yang pekerja keras.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:25.39,0:14:26.80,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lagi pula,
Dialogue: 10,0:14:27.18,0:14:31.81,dialog,,0,0,0,,saya rasa dialah pelacur\Npaling cantik di pulau ini.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:32.14,0:14:32.93,dialog,,0,0,0,,Iya.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:33.27,0:14:34.73,dialog,,0,0,0,,Saya rasa juga begitu.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:39.11,0:14:41.23,dialog,,0,0,0,,Gelagatnya kelihatan aneh...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:51.41,0:14:56.25,dialog,,0,0,0,,Saya dengar, di pulau ini ada pria\Nyang ingin menikahi Satoko.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:59.17,0:15:00.80,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apakah itu Anda?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:02.26,0:15:04.84,dialog,,0,0,0,,Benar, itu saya.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:06.64,0:15:08.35,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tidak bisa dibiarkan.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:09.10,0:15:11.93,dialog,,0,0,0,,Saya sudah secara resmi\Nmemberi uang tebusan.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:12.52,0:15:15.85,dialog,,0,0,0,,Satoko akan saya bawa pulang\Ndan saya jadikan istri.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:16.35,0:15:18.36,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tentu Anda akan menerimanya, kan?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:18.81,0:15:21.11,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau itu, tidak bisa.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:22.61,0:15:26.11,dialog,,0,0,0,,Saya akan selamanya tinggal\Ndengan Satoko di pulau ini.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:27.32,0:15:30.99,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau Satoko pergi ke luar,\Ndia cuma akan dikejar-kejar.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:30.99,0:15:34.29,dialog,,0,0,0,,Di sini tempat paling aman\Nuntuk kita berdua.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:34.29,0:15:36.33,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kamu serius bilang begitu?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:36.33,0:15:37.79,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jangan bicara yang tidak-tidak.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:37.79,0:15:39.75,dialog,,0,0,0,,Saya benar-benar serius, kok.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:39.75,0:15:42.05,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hanya saja ini perkara penting.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:42.05,0:15:44.71,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jadi tidak bisa diputuskan oleh saya sendiri.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:44.71,0:15:47.22,dialog,,0,0,0,,Satoko saja yang memutuskan.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:47.22,0:15:48.18,dialog,,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:48.18,0:15:50.89,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau putuskan saja tiga hari lagi.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:50.89,0:15:54.72,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kamu berniat menaiki kapal\Nmenuju pulau utama di hari itu, kan?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:54.72,0:15:57.27,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau begitu, silakan bersantai.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:02.77,0:16:05.74,dialog,,0,0,0,,Siapa sebenarnya pria itu?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:05.74,0:16:08.45,dialog,,0,0,0,,Pembunuh bayaran di pulau ini.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:08.45,0:16:12.49,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku bilang akan dapat segalanya\Nkalau menikah denganku.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:13.16,0:16:15.70,dialog,,0,0,0,,Cuma itu satu-satunya jalan\Nuntuk bertahan hidup.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:16.45,0:16:18.29,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tidak perlu takut lagi.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:18.67,0:16:21.21,dialog,,0,0,0,,Saya akan terus di sisi Anda\Nsampai keluar dari pulau.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:21.21,0:16:23.38,dialog,,0,0,0,,Be-Begini, Kotaro!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:23.38,0:16:25.59,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku bukannya ketakutan.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:25.59,0:16:27.72,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku cuma ingin membawa orang itu juga.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:28.59,0:16:32.47,dialog,,0,0,0,,Orang itu sudah berulang kali\Ntidak memedulikan nyawanya
Dialogue: 10,0:16:32.47,0:16:35.64,dialog,,0,0,0,,untuk menyelamatkanku, dialah penyelamatku!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:35.64,0:16:40.27,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tetapi, pria itu bilang ingin hidup di sini\Nbersama Nona Satoko.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:40.27,0:16:42.23,dialog,,0,0,0,,Memangnya bisa Anda bujuk?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:44.02,0:16:45.28,dialog,,0,0,0,,Oh, iya!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:45.28,0:16:48.36,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kemampuan berpedang orang itu\Nbukan kaleng-kaleng!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:48.36,0:16:51.95,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kira-kira apa Ayahanda mau mempekerjakannya\Nsebagai pengawal keluarga Kirigaya?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:51.95,0:16:54.16,dialog,,0,0,0,,Pria yang tidak jelas asal-usulnya\Nseperti dia,
Dialogue: 10,0:16:54.16,0:16:57.16,dialog,,0,0,0,,jelas tidak bisa dibiarkan masuk\Nke area kediaman Kirigaya.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:58.41,0:17:00.92,dialog,,0,0,0,,Benar juga, ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:00.92,0:17:04.54,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau di sini aku memilih pulang...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:06.13,0:17:09.80,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kami tidak akan bisa bertemu lagi\Nuntuk selamanya?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:12.93,0:17:15.01,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kenapa Anda malah ragu?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:15.01,0:17:16.06,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau begitu...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:16.06,0:17:19.73,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bisakah nanti setelah keluar dari sini,\Naku kembali lagi untuk berterima kasih?!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:20.81,0:17:21.73,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa tidak ada?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:22.02,0:17:24.48,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa tidak ada solusi lain yang lebih baik?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:24.48,0:17:27.90,dialog,,0,0,0,,Orang itu selama ini sudah\Nmelindungi diriku.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:30.24,0:17:32.99,dialog,,0,0,0,,Saya sudah lebih lama melindungi Anda.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:32.99,0:17:33.82,dialog,,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:35.24,0:17:36.95,dialog,,0,0,0,,Be-Benar juga.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:36.95,0:17:37.95,dialog,,0,0,0,,Maaf.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:37.95,0:17:41.12,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ah, saya sudah bicara lancang!\NSaya mohon maaf!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:42.96,0:17:46.34,dialog,,0,0,0,,Oh, iya, Anda suka konpeito, kan?!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:49.38,0:17:51.76,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kamu repot-repot membawakannya?!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:51.76,0:17:53.93,dialog,,0,0,0,,Saya juga membawakan obat.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:53.93,0:17:55.76,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bagaimana sakit di dada Anda selama di sini?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:55.76,0:17:58.72,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sebenarnya, aku sempat tumbang sekali...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:58.72,0:17:59.93,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tumbang?!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:00.31,0:18:01.89,dialog,,0,0,0,,Anda pingsan?!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:01.89,0:18:03.81,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apakah demam? Muntah darah?\NLuka...
Dialogue: 10,0:18:03.81,0:18:05.86,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku tidak apa-apa.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:06.40,0:18:07.86,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tolong ceritakan kondisinya secara rinci...
Dialogue: 10,0:18:07.86,0:18:10.11,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jangan pikirkan yang sudah lewat.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:18.20,0:18:20.37,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kotaro!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:20.37,0:18:24.25,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tolong berjanji,\NAnda tidak akan memaksakan diri.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:24.25,0:18:28.13,dialog,,0,0,0,,Segera lapor kalau kondisi Anda\Nmemburuk sedikit saja.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:28.75,0:18:30.96,dialog,,0,0,0,,Saya mengkhawatirkan Anda.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:32.59,0:18:35.39,dialog,,0,0,0,,Iya, baiklah, aku janji.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:37.93,0:18:39.35,dialog,,0,0,0,,Nona Satoko.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:39.72,0:18:42.89,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mimpi Anda menikah demi\Nkejayaan keluarga Kirigaya,
Dialogue: 10,0:18:42.89,0:18:44.56,dialog,,0,0,0,,apakah sekarang pun belum berubah?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:44.56,0:18:46.52,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kenapa menanyakan hal seperti itu?!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:46.52,0:18:47.61,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tentu saja belum.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:48.82,0:18:50.32,dialog,,0,0,0,,Saya jadi tenang.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:50.69,0:18:54.86,dialog,,0,0,0,,Saya sudah melihat seberapa keras\Nperjuangan Anda sejak kecil.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:55.41,0:18:59.12,dialog,,0,0,0,,Akan saya lakukan segalanya\Nbila Anda perlu bantuan untuk itu.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:59.12,0:19:03.04,dialog,,0,0,0,,Saya hidup demi mewujudkan mimpi Anda!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:03.62,0:19:05.33,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kotaro...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:06.08,0:19:07.71,dialog,,0,0,0,,Terima kasih.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:10.04,0:19:11.13,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya sudah.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:11.13,0:19:13.59,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sekarang sudah larut, ayo tidur.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:13.59,0:19:15.09,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mana bisa aku tidur!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:19.01,0:19:20.60,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mohon maaf.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:20.60,0:19:23.39,dialog,,0,0,0,,Katanya akan selalu di sisiku,\Njadi kupikir...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:23.39,0:19:26.81,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sa-Saya sudah minta disiapkan\Nkamar di sebelah.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:27.65,0:19:29.06,dialog,,0,0,0,,Permisi.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:33.23,0:19:35.36,dialog,,0,0,0,,"Mana bisa aku tidur!" katanya.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:35.36,0:19:37.32,dialog,,0,0,0,,Serasa kembali ke masa lalu.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:37.78,0:19:40.41,dialog,,0,0,0,,Syukurlah Kotaro datang ke sini.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:41.12,0:19:42.24,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:47.75,0:19:49.38,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku harus memilih.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:55.88,0:19:58.09,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apanya yang "sudah melindungi Anda"?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:58.09,0:20:00.76,dialog,,0,0,0,,Berani sekali bilang begitu\Npadahal diriku seperti ini.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:11.19,0:20:13.57,dialog,,0,0,0,,Pasti akan kubawa pulang dengan selamat.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:21.20,0:20:22.28,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa?!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:22.74,0:20:24.66,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tubuhku terasa aneh!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:24.66,0:20:25.37,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ini...
Dialogue: 10,0:20:26.04,0:20:27.37,dialog,,0,0,0,,racun?!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:29.83,0:20:31.58,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ulah pria itu, ya?!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:39.09,0:20:43.47,dialog,,0,0,0,,No... Nona Satoko?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:44.81,0:20:48.73,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sudah kuberi obat yang bisa\Nmembuat dia bermimpi indah.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:49.06,0:20:51.15,dialog,,0,0,0,,Di lilin yang ada di kamarnya.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:51.90,0:20:55.78,dialog,,0,0,0,,Efek halusinasi audiovisual\Ndan rangsangan seksual.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:55.78,0:20:59.57,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dengan kata lain, obat perangsang terlarang.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:00.03,0:21:01.70,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ini imbalannya.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:02.16,0:21:03.57,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lalu setelah itu...
Dialogue: 10,0:21:04.08,0:21:08.62,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dengan ujung jarum ini,\Nlukailah sedikit tubuhnya.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:20.05,0:21:23.01,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mana mungkin kubiarkan hidup\Nsampai tiga hari!
